<meta name='title' content="1M9O zinc site: TTP-family (Nup475) first finger, no RNA"/>
<meta name='description' content="NMR, 23 models. Model 1 as deposited. One unit is one angstrom. A bond to zinc glows only while it measures under 2.5 angstrom."/>
